## Project Overview

**Purpose**: Reference implementation for Agentic RAG applications using AWS Strands Agents SDK with tool-based document retrieval.

**Target Users**: Development teams building Agentic applications with AI-assisted coding tools.

**Current Status**: Production-ready agent framework with CLI interface, programmatic API, and multiple deployment patterns. Base agent infrastructure complete (Phase 4). Successfully migrated from RAG-specific implementation to general-purpose agent framework.

